#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:5
#: 3379439cb2dd46e6b39c740f7f712d03
msgid "Rotor Speed Control Setup"
msgstr "旋翼转速控制设置"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:7
#: 03d1a8badb61413c90946f4398f0bfac
msgid ""
"Unlike other vehicles, more specifically multicopters, the throttle RC "
"input channel does not directly control the throttle in any mode, even in"
" modes designated in Multicopter as \"non altitude controlled modes\" or "
"\"non throttle controlled modes\", like STABILIZE or ACRO. Instead it "
"only directly controls the Collective for the helicopter in non altitude "
"controlled modes."
msgstr ""
"与其他飞行器（特别是多旋翼）不同，油门遥控输入通道在任何模式下都不直接控制油门，即使在多旋翼中称为\"非高度控制模式\"或\"非油门控制模式\"（如"
" Stabilize 或 Acro）的模式中也不例外。相反，它只在非高度控制模式下直接控制直升机的总距。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:9
#: f5df9f3735434904b26654357478efd2
msgid ""
"the exception to this is the RC Passthrough RSC mode. This is NOT "
"recommended usually."
msgstr "例外情况是遥控直通 RSC 模式。通常不推荐使用此模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:11
#: ab12e3afed0a4a109e342195ef4fe26a
msgid ""
"This means that some method must be used to control the throttle or esc "
"for maintaining constant rotor speed through out the flight envelope."
msgstr "这意味着必须使用某种方法来控制油门或 ESC，以在整个飞行包线中保持恒定的旋翼转速。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:13
#: 4889423403914b9eab810f0f76c313bc
msgid ""
"The Rotor Speed Control (RSC) uses the heliRSC output "
"(``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` = 31) to the engine throttle or speed "
"control/governor to control rotor speed. This can be derived in a few "
"different ways:"
msgstr ""
"旋翼转速控制（RSC）使用 heliRSC 输出（``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` = "
"31）连接发动机油门或转速控制/调速器来控制旋翼转速。这可以通过几种不同方式实现："

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:15
#: 381959dc5a2d44be90b33808841ac12f
msgid ""
"Through an open loop control via either an RC transmitter passthrough or "
"an internal throttle curve which takes collective demand and creates a "
"corresponding throttle demand."
msgstr "通过遥控发射机直通或内部油门曲线的开环控制，内部油门曲线接收总距需求并产生相应的油门需求。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:16
#: 7c859dd430504d8e87b6efac4b592de9
msgid ""
"Using a set point signal to an external governor, or electronic speed "
"controller"
msgstr "向外部调速器或电子调速控制器发送设定点信号"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:17
#: 6dae619bc8574bd1b742e0bd51cd2216
msgid "Using a closed loop governor in the ArduPilot firmware."
msgstr "使用 ArduPilot 固件中的闭环调速器。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:19
#: 3ecee1ab0afe407b9559ab6a44b2c576
msgid ""
"When Motor Interlock is disengaged,the state is sometimes called Throttle"
" Hold and throttle is driven to :ref:`H_RSC_IDLE <H_RSC_IDLE>`"
msgstr "当电机联锁解除时，该状态有时称为油门锁定，油门被驱动到 :ref:`H_RSC_IDLE <H_RSC_IDLE>`"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:21
#: afd022ee32be4a799cb5b0ed82b76c47
msgid ""
"The RSC also controls the heliRSC output for ground idle, rotor run up "
"and shut down. This wiki covers the set up of each of the parameters in "
"the RSC."
msgstr "RSC 还控制地面怠速、旋翼启动和关闭的 heliRSC 输出。本 wiki 涵盖 RSC 中每个参数的设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:24
#: 528ed996e14b4e6da333f821a992f317
msgid "RSC mode"
msgstr "RSC 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:26
#: f81125ce932c4e609df406b726170d20
msgid ""
"First, set the RSC Mode parameter (:ref:`H_RSC_MODE <H_RSC_MODE>`). The "
"RSC modes are listed below with a short description."
msgstr "首先设置 RSC 模式参数（:ref:`H_RSC_MODE <H_RSC_MODE>`）。RSC 模式列于下方，附有简短说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:28
#: 1235023bcd184a0bb01b99052a566464
msgid ""
"RC Passthrough (:ref:`H_RSC_MODE <H_RSC_MODE>` = 1) - this mode passes "
"through the RC channel input on which the Motor Interlock (``RCx_OPTION``"
" =32) is assigned. The channel must be over 1200us in order for the "
"heliRSC output to follow the RC input. Otherwise, heliRSC will be "
":ref:`H_RSC_IDLE <H_RSC_IDLE>`."
msgstr ""
"遥控直通（:ref:`H_RSC_MODE <H_RSC_MODE>` = 1）- 此模式直通电机联锁（``RCx_OPTION`` "
"=32）所分配的 RC 通道输入。通道必须超过 1200us，heliRSC 输出才能跟随 RC 输入。否则，heliRSC 将为 "
":ref:`H_RSC_IDLE <H_RSC_IDLE>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:29
#: 7aa1d9e924374b1d8eca4348003cbc27
msgid ""
"RSC setpoint (:ref:`H_RSC_MODE <H_RSC_MODE>` = 2) - this mode is used for"
" helicopters utilizing either an electronic speed controller or an "
"external governor for internal combustion engines. The PWM passed to the "
"HeliRSC output is determined from the External Motor Governor Setpoint "
"(:ref:`H_RSC_SETPOINT <H_RSC_SETPOINT>`) parameter. The output PWM is "
"calculated by the following equation: PWM output = ``RSC_SETPOINT`` * "
"0.01 * (``SERVOx_MAX`` - ``SERVOx_MIN``) + ``SERVOx_MIN`` where SERVOx is"
" the output assigned to Throttle"
msgstr ""
"RSC 设定点（:ref:`H_RSC_MODE <H_RSC_MODE>` = 2）- "
"此模式用于使用电子调速控制器或内燃机外部调速器的直升机。传递到 HeliRSC 输出的 PWM "
"由外部电机调速器设定点（:ref:`H_RSC_SETPOINT <H_RSC_SETPOINT>`）参数确定。输出 PWM "
"按以下公式计算：PWM 输出 = ``RSC_SETPOINT`` * 0.01 * (``SERVOx_MAX`` - "
"``SERVOx_MIN``) + ``SERVOx_MIN``，其中 SERVOx 是分配给油门的输出"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:30
#: 7785b2bbaf44462d9cce62cf6b73f480
msgid ""
"Throttle curve (:ref:`H_RSC_MODE <H_RSC_MODE>` = 3) - This mode is an "
"open loop control of the HeliRSC servo output. Users will need to fine-"
"tune the throttle curve to maintain the desired rotor speed throughout "
"the flight envelope. The throttle curve is a five point spline curve fit "
"set by the ``H_RSC_THRCRV_x`` parameters. It is used to determine the "
"HeliRSC servo output based on the collective (throttle stick) on the RC "
"transmitter."
msgstr ""
"油门曲线（:ref:`H_RSC_MODE <H_RSC_MODE>` = 3）- 此模式是 HeliRSC "
"舵机输出的开环控制。用户需要精细调整油门曲线，以在整个飞行包线中保持期望的旋翼转速。油门曲线是由 ``H_RSC_THRCRV_x`` "
"参数设置的五点样条曲线拟合。它用于根据遥控发射机上的总距（油门摇杆）确定 HeliRSC 舵机输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:31
#: 3091a6b480df454fb476d2d26bae39c4
msgid ""
"Governor (:ref:`H_RSC_MODE <H_RSC_MODE>` = 4) - The governor is designed "
"to maintain a user specified rotor speed using the throttle curve as the "
"feedforward control. This feature requires a rotor speed sensor. The "
"``H_RSC_GOV_x``. The parameters needed to set  the Throttle Curve mode "
"above, also should be set correctly for this mode since it uses them as a"
" basis for feed-forward control in the Governor."
msgstr ""
"调速器（:ref:`H_RSC_MODE <H_RSC_MODE>` = 4）- "
"调速器设计为使用油门曲线作为前馈控制来维持用户指定的旋翼转速。此功能需要旋翼转速传感器。``H_RSC_GOV_x``。设置上述油门曲线模式所需的参数也应为此模式正确设置，因为它们用作调速器前馈控制的基础。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:34
#: 4b8b845fd25c44dfa5bafe51d71504d3
msgid ""
"Setting the RSC mode to RC Passthrough requires configuring the RC "
"receiver to hold last value for the Motor Interlock channel (default is "
"channel 8). If the receiver loses connection to the transmitter and "
"receiver is not configured correctly, the motor will shutdown and the "
"helicopter will crash! It also means that the pilot has to be in control "
"of throttle during any altitude holding or autonomous modes. This can be "
"very difficult, can lead to a crash, and is strongly discouraged. This "
"mode is provided only for some very specialized, advanced users."
msgstr ""
"将 RSC 模式设置为遥控直通需要配置遥控接收机，以保持电机联锁通道（默认为通道 "
"8）的最后值。如果接收机与发射机失去连接且接收机配置不正确，电机将关闭，直升机将坠毁！这也意味着飞手必须在任何高度保持或自主模式期间控制油门。这可能非常困难，可能导致坠毁，强烈不鼓励。此模式仅提供给一些非常专业的高级用户。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:37
#: b85050991ad14e5e8060e0c0438fe5f2
msgid ""
":ref:`H_RSC_MODE <H_RSC_MODE>` =2 will be the most commonly used mode for"
" electric helis having an ESC with governor mode built in."
msgstr ":ref:`H_RSC_MODE <H_RSC_MODE>` =2 将是具有内置调速器模式 ESC 的电动直升机最常用的模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:38
#: 428639ff7f7c402a90612a75fba51d42
msgid ""
":ref:`H_RSC_MODE <H_RSC_MODE>` =3 can be used for open loop control of "
"the heli motor, providing no constant head speed feedback control, but is"
" usually used to setup the feed-forward throttle curve baseline for the "
"Governor mode below. Having a RSC governor is highly desirable in order "
"to maintain a steady tune point for the stabilization parameters."
msgstr ""
":ref:`H_RSC_MODE <H_RSC_MODE>` =3 "
"可用于直升机电机的开环控制，不提供恒定转速反馈控制，但通常用于为下面的调速器模式设置前馈油门曲线基线。拥有 RSC "
"调速器是非常理想的，以保持稳定的调参点。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:39
#: 0d913326ae634d44a42923619deab198
msgid ""
":ref:`H_RSC_MODE <H_RSC_MODE>` =4 can be used if no external RSC governor"
" is present. Primarily for ICE and Turbine engines."
msgstr ":ref:`H_RSC_MODE <H_RSC_MODE>` =4 可在没有外部 RSC 调速器时使用。主要用于 ICE 和涡轮发动机。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:42
#: 34a09813c92345f5b9ab2b2f53854815
msgid "Typical Throttle Curves for :ref:`H_RSC_MODE<H_RSC_MODE>` = 3"
msgstr ":ref:`H_RSC_MODE<H_RSC_MODE>` = 3 的典型油门曲线"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:44
#: 6bae5d83999b49eca451257eb05b13d9
msgid ""
"These are also used in :ref:`H_RSC_MODE<H_RSC_MODE>` = 4 as a basis for "
"its feedforward."
msgstr "这些也在 :ref:`H_RSC_MODE<H_RSC_MODE>` = 4 中用作其前馈的基础。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:46
#: c79a7de77c4c4e74ac08808cf40a5e07
msgid ""
"If the collective range is set for conventional (non-aerobatic) setups, "
"ie ~-2deg to +12deg, then the ``H_RSC_THRCRV_X`` parameters would be set "
"to drive the Throttle Servo similarly to:"
msgstr "如果总距范围设置为常规（非特技）设置，即约 -2 度到 +12 度，则 ``H_RSC_THRCRV_X`` 参数应设置为以类似方式驱动油门舵机："

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:51
#: 2ff342359630455b8c986a3ed901bb51
msgid ""
"If setup with an aerobatic, symmetrical collective range, ie ~ -12deg to "
"+12deg, then they should be set drive the Throttle Servo similarly to "
"this:"
msgstr "如果设置为特技、对称的总距范围，即约 -12 度到 +12 度，则应设置为以这种方式驱动油门舵机："

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:56
#: 5ea1c8e66a9c49dab75b885017de2a28
msgid ""
"ArduPilot will spline curve fit between the ``H_RSC_THRCRV_X`` setpoints "
"to produce smooth throttle servo output versus collective points."
msgstr "ArduPilot 将在 ``H_RSC_THRCRV_X`` 设定点之间进行样条曲线拟合，以产生平滑的油门舵机输出与总距点的关系。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:59
#: dd8ffdf385594f2d8c5e6febae8260dc
msgid "Rotor Speed Ramp and Idle Settings"
msgstr "旋翼转速加速和怠速设置"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:61
#: 754671f5358b4addbb508f56026b16b0
msgid ""
"The rotor speed control features an idle setting and start up and shut "
"down logic for throttle control. The throttle output at :ref:`H_RSC_IDLE "
"<H_RSC_IDLE>` parameter determines the output to heliRSC servo output "
"after the aircraft is armed, but before the motor interlock is enabled."
msgstr ""
"旋翼转速控制具有怠速设置以及油门控制的启动和关闭逻辑。:ref:`H_RSC_IDLE <H_RSC_IDLE>` "
"参数处的油门输出决定了飞行器解锁后、电机联锁启用前对 heliRSC 舵机输出的输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:63
#: 42ddb998d652457da0f1598da2946ced
msgid ""
"When the motor interlock is enabled the rotor speed control will ramp the"
" throttle from the idle setting (:ref:`H_RSC_IDLE <H_RSC_IDLE>`) to "
"flight setting (this depends on the :ref:`H_RSC_MODE <H_RSC_MODE>` "
"chosen) based on the :ref:`H_RSC_RAMP_TIME <H_RSC_RAMP_TIME>` parameter ."
" The RSC will prevent take off in non-manual throttle modes and auto mode"
" until the timer has reached :ref:`H_RSC_RUNUP_TIME <H_RSC_RUNUP_TIME>`. "
"It is very important to set :ref:`H_RSC_RUNUP_TIME <H_RSC_RUNUP_TIME>` to"
" the amount of time it takes for the rotor to spin up to the flight rotor"
" speed.  This parameter has to be equal to or greater than the Throttle "
"Ramp Time parameter (:ref:`H_RSC_RAMP_TIME <H_RSC_RAMP_TIME>`)."
msgstr ""
"当电机联锁启用时，旋翼转速控制将根据 :ref:`H_RSC_RAMP_TIME <H_RSC_RAMP_TIME>` "
"参数，将油门从怠速设置（:ref:`H_RSC_IDLE <H_RSC_IDLE>`）升高到飞行设置（取决于所选的 "
":ref:`H_RSC_MODE <H_RSC_MODE>`）。RSC 将在非手动油门模式和自动模式下阻止起飞，直到计时器达到 "
":ref:`H_RSC_RUNUP_TIME <H_RSC_RUNUP_TIME>`。非常重要的是将 :ref:`H_RSC_RUNUP_TIME"
" <H_RSC_RUNUP_TIME>` "
"设置为旋翼加速到飞行旋翼转速所需的时间。此参数必须等于或大于油门升温时间参数（:ref:`H_RSC_RAMP_TIME "
"<H_RSC_RAMP_TIME>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:65
#: 6dee9b73d99d4a0cb4bdf2fee97d69fc
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When the motor interlock is disabled with the rotor at flight rotor "
"speed, the rotor speed control will count down the same amount of time as"
" specified by the :ref:`H_RSC_RUNUP_TIME <H_RSC_RUNUP_TIME>`. The RSC "
"will declare rotor speed below critical based on the Critical Rotor Speed"
" parameter (:ref:`H_RSC_CRITICAL <H_RSC_CRITICAL>`) and will reset the "
"runup complete flag. It is best to set the Critical Rotor Speed parameter"
" (:ref:`H_RSC_CRITICAL <H_RSC_CRITICAL>`) for a percentage of the runup "
"timer that equates to about three seconds. For example if you had a 10 "
"second runup timer, setting the Critical Rotor Speed parameter "
"(:ref:`H_RSC_CRITICAL <H_RSC_CRITICAL>`) to 70% will cause the RSC to "
"declare rotor speed below critical three seconds from when Motor "
"interlock is disabled.  For versions 4.0 and earlier, the autopilot is "
"able to disarm the aircraft during auto landings after the RSC declares "
"the rotor speed below critical.  For versions 4.1 and later, the "
"autopilot waits the length of time of the :ref:`H_RSC_RUNUP_TIME "
"<H_RSC_RUNUP_TIME>` to disarm the aircraft during auto landings."
msgstr ""
"当旋翼处于飞行转速时禁用电机联锁，旋翼转速控制将按照 :ref:`H_RSC_RUNUP_TIME <H_RSC_RUNUP_TIME>` "
"指定的相同时间倒计时。RSC 将根据临界旋翼转速参数（:ref:`H_RSC_CRITICAL "
"<H_RSC_CRITICAL>`）声明旋翼转速低于临界值，并将复位启动完成标志。最好将临界旋翼转速参数（:ref:`H_RSC_CRITICAL"
" <H_RSC_CRITICAL>`）设置为启动计时器的一个百分比，该百分比对应于大约三秒。例如，如果您有一个 10 "
"秒的启动计时器，将临界旋翼转速参数（:ref:`H_RSC_CRITICAL <H_RSC_CRITICAL>`）设置为 70% 将导致 RSC "
"在电机联锁禁用三秒后声明旋翼转速低于临界值。对于 4.0 及更早版本，飞控能够在 RSC "
"声明旋翼转速低于临界值后在自动降落期间解除飞行器上锁。对于 4.1 及更高版本，飞控在自动降落期间等待 "
":ref:`H_RSC_RUNUP_TIME <H_RSC_RUNUP_TIME>` 的时长才解除飞行器上锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:68
#: 331585a740d34a7db705435db6659ace
msgid "ArduPilot Internal Governor Setup"
msgstr "ArduPilot 内部调速器设置"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:70
#: 065d4e0fa87d41728197d381feb745cd
msgid ""
"ArduPilot provides an internal rotor speed control primarily for use with"
" ICE or Turbine engines without a speed governor, but can also be used "
"with electric ESCs that do not provide a governor mode. This mode "
"requires that the ``H_RSC_THRCRV_x`` parameters be set such that the "
"helicopter can be flown in :ref:`H_RSC_MODE <H_RSC_MODE>` =3 safely, "
"since they are used as the baseline control curve for the RSC governor, "
"providing the feed-forward portion of the control loop."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 提供内部旋翼转速控制，主要用于没有转速调速器的 ICE 或涡轮发动机，但也可用于不提供调速器模式的电动 ESC。此模式需要设置"
" ``H_RSC_THRCRV_x`` 参数，使直升机可以安全地在 :ref:`H_RSC_MODE <H_RSC_MODE>` =3 "
"模式下飞行，因为它们用作 RSC 调速器的基准控制曲线，提供控制回路的前馈部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:73
#: b8ba77f7719249d29044a3a971bd95f6
msgid "See :ref:`traditional-helicopter-internal-rsc-governor` for setup details."
msgstr "有关设置详情，请参见 :ref:`traditional-helicopter-internal-rsc-governor`。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:76
#: f1547206812a42f1ac96f103d301b735
msgid "Turbine Engine Start"
msgstr "涡轮发动机启动"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-rsc-setup.rst:78
#: fbfe07069a0044e09e69cba69c1fc2cc
msgid ""
"A special RC Auxiliary Function (\"159\") is implemented to provide the "
"start signal RC switch for turbine engines. When armed and RSC is idle, "
"the high position signals the helicopter rotor speed governor to ramp the"
" throttle to full and back to idle, which signals the turbine engine ECU "
"to initiate the start sequence. The switch must be set back low and "
"aircraft has to be disarmed to re-enable this feature."
msgstr ""
"实现了一个特殊的 RC 辅助功能（\"159\"），为涡轮发动机提供启动信号 RC 开关。当解锁且 RSC "
"处于怠速时，高位置信号直升机旋翼转速调速器将油门升至全油门再回到怠速，这向涡轮发动机 ECU "
"发信号启动启动序列。开关必须重新设置为低位，且飞行器必须上锁才能重新启用此功能。"

